# Express Routes Instructions When working in route files: - Always wrap async handlers with
`asyncHandler()` - Validate request body with Zod schemas before processing - Return consistent
response format: `{ data }` or `{ error, message }` - Use correct HTTP status codes (201 for
created, 204 for deleted) - Keep routes thin — delegate logic to service layer - Import validators
from `../validators/` directory - Register new routes in `routes/index.ts`
